{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan verified against the tree before implementing. Every factual claim held (only line-number drift: `derive_caused_by` is at blame.py:184 not :171; the two pinned tests are at test_bugfix_size_gate_ad0d.py:323/:339 not :304/:320; the docs section starts at plan-review-gate.md:1060 not :1058). The 'review-plan mirror is a no-op' constraint checks out: `bug_blast_radius_escalates` returns True for any non-test path in `file_impact`.\n\nTwo ACs did NOT hold as written and were corrected:\n\n1. AC1's unanchored `grep -c` prints 7, not 3 — it counts the definitions plus their in-module uses. Anchored to `^` it prints 3, which is what the criterion meant.\n2. AC7 (`--check-planning-corpus` exits 0) fails on current `origin/main`: `corpus=114 (want 113); missed=[]; mechanical_fp=[]; FAIL`. Reproduced unchanged on a pristine detached worktree at `origin/main`, so it is pre-existing, not caused by this change — filed as bug 648b-7882-497f-45fc (grateful-electronic-vaquita) and linked `discovered_from`. The half of the check this AC actually pins — that `flagged` still means the size floor alone — passes: `missed=[]`, `mechanical_fp=[]`.\n\nBacktest re-measured on today's `origin/main` (645 bug-fix commits, 24 labelled from `caused_by`):\n\n| predicate | recall | escalation |\n|---|---|---|\n| size (floor) | 10/24 (41.7%) | 105/645 (16.3%) |\n| repeat-fix | 12/24 (50.0%) | 227/645 (35.2%) |\n| union | 14/24 (58.3%) | 253/645 (39.2%) |\n\nThe floor row reconciles exactly with the plan's measurement (105 flagged at 16.3%); the plan saw 644 commits and 22 labels, today 645 and 24. Repeat-fix recall and escalation land within a point of the planned figures."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787379029247313001,"uuid":"54c7633b-ee9f-4b54-b41d-1edb9bfbadfb"}